WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:04.475
Okay, so an MCP server gives an AI client tools,

2
00:00:04.475 --> 00:00:06.827
and the model calls each tool by name.

3
00:00:06.827 --> 00:00:08.527
With the Python SDK,

4
00:00:08.787 --> 00:00:11.337
each type-hinted function becomes a tool,

5
00:00:11.337 --> 00:00:14.137
and its docstring is what the model reads to choose one.

6
00:00:14.137 --> 00:00:17.587
A tool's arguments come from the model as plain strings,

7
00:00:17.807 --> 00:00:22.233
so I'd resolve every path before checking it's inside the docs folder.

8
00:00:22.233 --> 00:00:24.598
The tool's output format matters too,

9
00:00:24.598 --> 00:00:27.533
because when read_doc returned plain text,

10
00:00:27.713 --> 00:00:30.212
Claude cited the right line in one run of four.

11
00:00:30.212 --> 00:00:33.447
With numbered lines it was four of four,

12
00:00:33.632 --> 00:00:38.187
so I'd return what the model has to cite ready to copy.
